hold on to your loved ones because we  have a star-studded cast featuring Poe  Dameron King Arthur the Chilean guy from  Game of Thrones  fat man and a guy named Garrett in the  most botched heist film since ocean's 8  Netflix is triple frontier centers  around a group of ex-military who hatch  a plan to rob one of Brazil's biggest  drug lords the only problem is that it  goes horribly horribly wrong so in this  video we're gonna take a deep dive into  the ending and figure out just what  happened the movie ends with Benny  catfish iron head and Pope all giving up  their share of the heist money to read  fly's family trust fund and amount  totaling over five million dollars  that's about 2% of the total 250 million  they had originally grabbed from Gabriel  aurea's stash each of the men feel  tremendous guilt not only for red flies  death but for the countless other lives  they destroyed along the way as catfish  says to Benny I killed those people no  you did we all did  everyone is complicit in these deaths  the initial plan was to have only one  casualty  Gabriela Raya the ruthless drug lord who  committed mass executions in his  backyard  yet when all is said and done the team  ends up killing dozens of people  including farmers and teenagers and that  guilt eats away at them triple frontier  is a parable on how greed corrupts it's  greed that causes red fly to take more  money than they can handle  greed which causes the helicopter to be  weighed down by taking on too much cash  and greed which slows down the men so  that they're eventually caught by two  teenagers looking for revenge red flies  death is a direct consequence of greed  and the other men know it it gets to the  point which the money becomes  meaningless they burn it to keep warm  and even laugh while doing it their  lives are worth more than any amount of  money and they end up tossing the rest  in a chasm where no one can get to it  the five million they get at the end is  all that they could carry on themselves  but even then they all agree money can't  buy their friend back or relieve the  guilt they have placed upon themselves  the men all go their separate ways but  right before iron had asked Pope what  he'll do now that  the mission is over pope half jokes that  he'll go see this girl he knows in  Australia of course referring to you  vana  Yvonne Oh is Pope's informant and lover  who he helped smuggled out of the  country with three million dollars  Yvonne is the only one in the film who's  not corrupted by greed and she gets away  because of it her motivations unlike the  men are driven by the love for her  brother she'll do anything even risk her  life to save him they men on the other  hand risked their lives not for the good  of the people but for their own monetary  gain if Pope really cared about taking  out Lauria so that the people would no  longer be terrorized by this drug lord  he'd have done the right thing and  completed the mission with a help with  the army Pope is an interesting  character who deep down is a good person  in the beginning when he takes down the  drug den it's obvious he's good at what  he does he's calm and collected in the  face of extreme danger saves a wounded  soldier and even lets one of the other  officers take credit for the explosion  that let them advance for Pope it's not  about awards or accolades but his one  critical flaw greed is ultimately his  own demise it's also interesting to note  that Metallica's for whom the bell  tolled plays here foreshadowing the  death that will eventually plague our  characters in this way triple frontier  is an Aristotelian tragedy with the  characters succumbing to their flaws and  thus being punished for it but there is  a glimmer of hope  at the end Ironhead hands Pope a note  with coordinates the coordinates to the  chasm where they dropped the money and  as Pope disappears into the crowd were  left with the following question will he  go back for the money or will he let it  go and just for fun I typed in those  coordinates into Google and all I got  was the ocean off the coast of Brazil so  good luck for any of you trying to find  it the ending also takes place in st.  John's Antigua you can tell by the  cruise ship in the background in the  street named Prince class as well as the  fact Pope said they would get paid  through a company in Saint John's the  capital of Antigua finally I want to  take a look at the beginning scene where  Ironhead talks to a bunch of Army  soldiers he talks about how the effects  of committing extreme acts of violence  on others create biological and  physiological changes he calls this the  price of being a warrior and that's a  price all of our characters must pay and  now they must live with the  Changez some physical like getting shot  but mostly emotional the guilt and all  for what a payday that never panned out  my guess is that Pope won't go back for  the money  no amount will ever bring his friend  back nor get rid of the crimes he and  his team committed but what do you think  leave a comment below and let me know  what you thought of triple frontier make  sure to LIKE and subscribe and follow me  on twitter at pink story YT until next  time remember daddy loves you very much
 

